<TD VALIGN="bottom" WIDTH="64%"> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Except for that portion of each Trading Company&#146;s assets used as margin to maintain that Trading Company&#146;s forward currency
contract positions, the proceeds of the offering for each Series will be deposited in cash in segregated accounts in the name of each Trading Company maintained for each Trading Company at the Clearing Brokers in accordance with CFTC segregation
requirements. The Clearing Brokers credit each Trading Company with 80%-100% of the interest earned on its average </FONT></P></TD></TR>
