<TD VALIGN="top" WIDTH="32%"> <P STYLE="margin-left:1.00em; text-indent:-1.00em"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Reports&nbsp;and&nbsp;Accounting</FONT></P></TD>
