not take or voluntarily permit to be taken any affirmative action to reduce the Managing Owner&#146;s net worth below any regulation-required amounts. </FONT></P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P
