SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">You will not be taxed on any cash distributions or partial redemption payments from the Trust until the aggregate amount you
