<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">With respect to Class 1 of the Balanced Series of Units, as compensation, the Selling Agents will receive a service fee at an annual rate of up to 3.0% of the subscription amount of
