STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I></I>Mr. Eesteren, born in 1959, joined C-View in May 2001 and is a Director at C-View. Prior to joining &nbsp;C-View, he was at Dresdner Kleinwort
Wasserstein, London, where he ran Foreign Exchange Proprietary Trading from 1998 to 2001. Mr. Eesteren started his financial career at Salomon Brothers (formerly Philipp Brothers) in New York, and then became a Senior Proprietary Trader and Global
