FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The C-View Currency Program (1x &amp; 3x)&#146;s approach is discretionary, based on a combination of fundamental analysis, technical analysis and market psychology. The intention is to capture profits from short to
medium-term price trends while maintaining profitability in ranging markets. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT
