<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The Managing Owner will receive a monthly management fee of approximately 0.167% (2.00% annually) of the Beach Series&#146; Net Asset Value, which it will use to pay all management
