<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">With respect to Class 1 of the C-View Currency Series of Units, as compensation, the Selling Agents will receive a service fee at an annual rate of up to 3.0% of the subscription
amount of each subscription for Units in Class 1 of the C-View Currency Series sold by them. The service fee for the first year will be prepaid by the Managing Owner. If you redeem all or a portion of your Units in Class 1 of the C-View Currency
